{
    "background_story": "In a mystical realm of sparkling meadows and shimmering waterfalls, a rare and majestic unicorn named Chosen was born. Her coat glistened with a soft, cerise hue, a color so vibrant it seemed almost otherworldly. As she grew, Chosen's mane and tail flowed with a subtle, rose-tinted glow, reflecting the gentle warmth of her heart. With a horn that shone like polished crystal, she possessed the power to heal the deepest wounds and bring solace to troubled spirits. Chosen roamed the land, spreading joy and peace wherever she went, leaving trails of cerise-hued wildflowers in her wake. Her beauty and kindness inspired a sense of wonder, reminding all who beheld her of the magic that lay just beyond the edge of everyday reality.",
